@prefix core: <https://dexa.art/learnmap/ontology/k12-core#> .

# A source-grounded draft that never names the passage it was written from. The core content shape
# must reject it, otherwise authored evidence could claim source grounding with no locator.
<urn:fixture:topic-f-unsourced-draft>
  core:facetKey core:facet-inquiry ;
  core:contentKind core:content-source-grounded-draft ;
  core:misconception "학습자는 근거 없이 결론을 단정한다."@ko .
